---@field RecordWrapperType? aws.sagemaker.RecordWrapper|string Specify RecordIO as the value when input data is in raw format but the training algorithm requires the RecordIO format. In this case, SageMaker wraps each individual S3 object in a RecordIO record. If the input data is already in RecordIO format, you don't need to set this attribute. For more information, see Create a Dataset Using RecordIO. In File mode, leave this field unset or set it to None.
