---@field LaunchTime aws.sagemaker.Timestamp The time when the instance is launched.
---@field LastSoftwareUpdateTime? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp The time when SageMaker last updated the software of the instances in the cluster.
---@field InstanceStatus aws.sagemaker.ClusterInstanceStatusDetails The status of the instance.
---@field UltraServerInfo? aws.sagemaker.UltraServerInfo Contains information about the UltraServer.
---@field PrivateDnsHostname? aws.sagemaker.ClusterPrivateDnsHostname The private DNS hostname of the SageMaker HyperPod cluster node.
---@field CurrentImageReleaseVersion? aws.sagemaker.ImageReleaseVersion The version of the HyperPod-managed AMI currently running on the node.
---@field ImageVersionStatus? aws.sagemaker.ClusterImageVersionStatus The status of the image version for the cluster node.

