---@class aws.sagemaker.CreateMlflowTrackingServerRequest
---@field TrackingServerName aws.sagemaker.TrackingServerName A unique string identifying the tracking server name. This string is part of the tracking server ARN.
---@field ArtifactStoreUri aws.sagemaker.S3Uri The S3 URI for a general purpose bucket to use as the MLflow Tracking Server artifact store.
---@field TrackingServerSize? aws.sagemaker.TrackingServerSize|string The size of the tracking server you want to create. You can choose between "Small", "Medium", and "Large". The default MLflow Tracking Server configuration size is "Small". You can choose a size depending on the projected use of the tracking server such as the volume of data logged, number of users, and frequency of use.
---@field MlflowVersion? aws.sagemaker.MlflowVersion The version of MLflow that the tracking server uses. To see which MLflow versions are available to use, see How it works.
---@field RoleArn aws.sagemaker.RoleArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) for an IAM role in your account that the MLflow Tracking Server uses to access the artifact store in Amazon S3. The role should have AmazonS3FullAccess permissions. For more information on IAM permissions for tracking server creation, see Set up IAM permissions for MLflow.
---@field AutomaticModelRegistration? aws.sagemaker.Boolean Whether to enable or disable automatic registration of new MLflow models to the SageMaker Model Registry. To enable automatic model registration, set this value to True. To disable automatic model registration, set this value to False. If not specified, AutomaticModelRegistration defaults to False.
---@field WeeklyMaintenanceWindowStart? aws.sagemaker.WeeklyMaintenanceWindowStart The day and time of the week in Coordinated Universal Time (UTC) 24-hour standard time that weekly maintenance updates are scheduled. For example: TUE:03:30.
---@field Tags? aws.sagemaker.TagList Tags consisting of key-value pairs used to manage metadata for the tracking server.
---@field S3BucketOwnerAccountId? aws.sagemaker.AccountId Expected Amazon Web Services account ID that owns the Amazon S3 bucket for artifact storage. Defaults to caller's account ID if not provided.
---@field S3BucketOwnerVerification? aws.sagemaker.Boolean Enable Amazon S3 Ownership checks when interacting with Amazon S3 buckets from a SageMaker Managed MLflow Tracking Server. Defaults to True if not provided.

---@class aws.sagemaker.CreateMlflowTrackingServerResponse
---@field TrackingServerArn? aws.sagemaker.TrackingServerArn The ARN of the tracking server.

