---@field IdcConfig? aws.sagemaker.IdcConfigInput Specifies the Amazon Web Services IAM Identity Center configuration for the SageMaker Partner AI App. Specify this parameter when AuthType is IDC. Apps that use IAM authorization don't use this parameter.
---@field AuthType aws.sagemaker.PartnerAppAuthType|string The authorization type that users use to access the SageMaker Partner AI App. Valid values:
---@field EnableIamSessionBasedIdentity? aws.sagemaker.Boolean When set to TRUE, the SageMaker Partner AI App sets the Amazon Web Services IAM session name or the authenticated IAM user as the identity of the SageMaker Partner AI App user.
---@field EnableAutoMinorVersionUpgrade? aws.sagemaker.Boolean When set to TRUE, the SageMaker Partner AI App is automatically upgraded to the latest minor version during the next scheduled maintenance window, if one is available. Default is FALSE.
---@field ClientToken? aws.sagemaker.ClientToken A unique token that guarantees that the call to this API is idempotent.
---@field Tags? aws.sagemaker.TagList Each tag consists of a key and an optional value. Tag keys must be unique per resource.

---@class aws.sagemaker.CreatePartnerAppResponse
