---@field TransformOutput? aws.sagemaker.TransformOutput Identifies the Amazon S3 location where you want Amazon SageMaker to save the results from the transform job.
---@field DataCaptureConfig? aws.sagemaker.BatchDataCaptureConfig Configuration to control how SageMaker captures inference data.
---@field TransformResources aws.sagemaker.TransformResources Describes the resources, including ML instance types and ML instance count, to use for the transform job.
---@field CreationTime aws.sagemaker.Timestamp A timestamp that shows when the transform Job was created.
---@field TransformStartTime? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp Indicates when the transform job starts on ML instances. You are billed for the time interval between this time and the value of TransformEndTime.
---@field TransformEndTime? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp Indicates when the transform job has been completed, or has stopped or failed. You are billed for the time interval between this time and the value of TransformStartTime.
---@field LabelingJobArn? aws.sagemaker.LabelingJobArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the Amazon SageMaker Ground Truth labeling job that created the transform or training job.
---@field AutoMLJobArn? aws.sagemaker.AutoMLJobArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the AutoML transform job.
---@field DataProcessing? aws.sagemaker.DataProcessing
