---@field LocalPath aws.sagemaker.ProcessingLocalPath Path to the filesystem where the endpoint data is available to the container.
---@field S3InputMode? aws.sagemaker.ProcessingS3InputMode|string Whether the Pipe or File is used as the input mode for transferring data for the monitoring job. Pipe mode is recommended for large datasets. File mode is useful for small files that fit in memory. Defaults to File.
---@field S3DataDistributionType? aws.sagemaker.ProcessingS3DataDistributionType|string Whether input data distributed in Amazon S3 is fully replicated or sharded by an Amazon S3 key. Defaults to FullyReplicated
---@field FeaturesAttribute? aws.sagemaker.String The attributes of the input data that are the input features.
---@field InferenceAttribute? aws.sagemaker.String The attribute of the input data that represents the ground truth label.
---@field ProbabilityAttribute? aws.sagemaker.String In a classification problem, the attribute that represents the class probability.
---@field ProbabilityThresholdAttribute? aws.sagemaker.ProbabilityThresholdAttribute The threshold for the class probability to be evaluated as a positive result.
---@field StartTimeOffset? aws.sagemaker.MonitoringTimeOffsetString If specified, monitoring jobs substract this time from the start time. For information about using offsets for scheduling monitoring jobs, see Schedule Model Quality Monitoring Jobs.
---@field EndTimeOffset? aws.sagemaker.MonitoringTimeOffsetString If specified, monitoring jobs substract this time from the end time. For information about using offsets for scheduling monitoring jobs, see Schedule Model Quality Monitoring Jobs.
---@field ExcludeFeaturesAttribute? aws.sagemaker.ExcludeFeaturesAttribute The attributes of the input data to exclude from the analysis.

