---@field IsTunable? aws.sagemaker.Boolean Indicates whether this hyperparameter is tunable in a hyperparameter tuning job.
---@field IsRequired? aws.sagemaker.Boolean Indicates whether this hyperparameter is required.
---@field DefaultValue? aws.sagemaker.HyperParameterValue The default value for this hyperparameter. If a default value is specified, a hyperparameter cannot be required.

