---The configuration of resources, including compute instances and storage volumes for use in training jobs launched by hyperparameter tuning jobs. HyperParameterTuningResourceConfig is similar to ResourceConfig, but has the additional InstanceConfigs and AllocationStrategy fields to allow for flexible instance management. Specify one or more instance types, count, and the allocation strategy for ins...
