---@field CurrentCopyCount? aws.sagemaker.InferenceComponentCopyCount The number of runtime copies of the model container that are currently deployed.
---@field PlacementStatus? aws.sagemaker.InferenceComponentPlacementStatusList The placement status of the inference component across instance types. Shows how the inference component copies are distributed across instance types.

