---@field CreatedBy? aws.sagemaker.UserContext Information about the user who created or modified an experiment, trial, trial component, lineage group, or project.
---@field MetadataProperties? aws.sagemaker.MetadataProperties Metadata properties of the tracking entity, trial, or trial component.
---@field ModelMetrics? aws.sagemaker.ModelMetrics Metrics for the model.
---@field LastModifiedTime? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp The last time the model package was modified.
---@field LastModifiedBy? aws.sagemaker.UserContext Information about the user who created or modified an experiment, trial, trial component, lineage group, or project.
---@field ApprovalDescription? aws.sagemaker.ApprovalDescription A description provided when the model approval is set.
---@field Domain? aws.sagemaker.String The machine learning domain of your model package and its components. Common machine learning domains include computer vision and natural language processing.
---@field Task? aws.sagemaker.String The machine learning task your model package accomplishes. Common machine learning tasks include object detection and image classification.
---@field SamplePayloadUrl? aws.sagemaker.String The Amazon Simple Storage Service path where the sample payload are stored. This path must point to a single gzip compressed tar archive (.tar.gz suffix).
---@field AdditionalInferenceSpecifications? aws.sagemaker.AdditionalInferenceSpecifications An array of additional Inference Specification objects.
---@field SourceUri? aws.sagemaker.ModelPackageSourceUri The URI of the source for the model package.
---@field SecurityConfig? aws.sagemaker.ModelPackageSecurityConfig
---@field ModelCard? aws.sagemaker.ModelPackageModelCard
---@field ModelLifeCycle? aws.sagemaker.ModelLifeCycle A structure describing the current state of the model in its life cycle.
---@field Tags? aws.sagemaker.TagList A list of the tags associated with the model package. For more information, see Tagging Amazon Web Services resources in the Amazon Web Services General Reference Guide.
---@field CustomerMetadataProperties? aws.sagemaker.CustomerMetadataMap The metadata properties for the model package.
---@field DriftCheckBaselines? aws.sagemaker.DriftCheckBaselines Represents the drift check baselines that can be used when the model monitor is set using the model package.
---@field SkipModelValidation? aws.sagemaker.SkipModelValidation Indicates if you want to skip model validation.

