---@field ModelInput? aws.sagemaker.ModelInput A structure with Model Input details.
---@field Framework? aws.sagemaker.String The machine learning framework of the model package container image.
---@field FrameworkVersion? aws.sagemaker.ModelPackageFrameworkVersion The framework version of the Model Package Container Image.
---@field NearestModelName? aws.sagemaker.String The name of a pre-trained machine learning benchmarked by Amazon SageMaker Inference Recommender model that matches your model. You can find a list of benchmarked models by calling ListModelMetadata.
