---@field RoutingConfig? aws.sagemaker.ProductionVariantRoutingConfig Settings that control how the endpoint routes incoming traffic to the instances that the endpoint hosts.
---@field AcceleratorPartitionLayouts? aws.sagemaker.AcceleratorPartitionLayouts The accelerator partition layout that SageMaker is applying to this production variant. On NVIDIA GPUs, the profiles are Multi-Instance GPU (MIG) profiles. SageMaker returns the accelerator partition layout as you provided it in the pending deployment configuration, without normalization.

