---@alias aws.sagemaker.ProductionVariantSSMAccess boolean

---Specifies the serverless configuration for an endpoint variant.
---@class aws.sagemaker.ProductionVariantServerlessConfig
---@field MemorySizeInMB aws.sagemaker.ServerlessMemorySizeInMB The memory size of your serverless endpoint. Valid values are in 1 GB increments: 1024 MB, 2048 MB, 3072 MB, 4096 MB, 5120 MB, or 6144 MB.
---@field MaxConcurrency aws.sagemaker.ServerlessMaxConcurrency The maximum number of concurrent invocations your serverless endpoint can process.
---@field ProvisionedConcurrency? aws.sagemaker.ServerlessProvisionedConcurrency The amount of provisioned concurrency to allocate for the serverless endpoint. Should be less than or equal to MaxConcurrency.

---Specifies the serverless update concurrency configuration for an endpoint variant.
