---@field MaxConcurrency? aws.sagemaker.ServerlessMaxConcurrency The updated maximum number of concurrent invocations your serverless endpoint can process.
---@field ProvisionedConcurrency? aws.sagemaker.ServerlessProvisionedConcurrency The updated amount of provisioned concurrency to allocate for the serverless endpoint. Should be less than or equal to MaxConcurrency.

