---@field DataAnalysisEndTime? aws.sagemaker.String Sets the end time for a monitoring job window. Express this time as an offset to the times that you schedule your monitoring jobs to run. You schedule monitoring jobs with the ScheduleExpression parameter. Specify this offset in ISO 8601 duration format. For example, if you want to end the window one hour before the start of each monitoring job, you would specify: "-PT1H".

