---@alias aws.sagemaker.TrainingInstanceTypes (aws.sagemaker.TrainingInstanceType|string)[]

---Contains information about a training job.
---@class aws.sagemaker.TrainingJob
---@field TrainingJobName? aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobName The name of the training job.
---@field TrainingJobArn? aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the training job.
---@field TuningJobArn? aws.sagemaker.HyperParameterTuningJobArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the associated hyperparameter tuning job if the training job was launched by a hyperparameter tuning job.
---@field LabelingJobArn? aws.sagemaker.LabelingJobArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the labeling job.
---@field AutoMLJobArn? aws.sagemaker.AutoMLJobArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the job.
---@field ModelArtifacts? aws.sagemaker.ModelArtifacts Information about the Amazon S3 location that is configured for storing model artifacts.
---@field TrainingJobStatus? aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobStatus The status of the training job.
---@field SecondaryStatus? aws.sagemaker.SecondaryStatus Provides detailed information about the state of the training job. For detailed information about the secondary status of the training job, see StatusMessage under SecondaryStatusTransition.
---@field FailureReason? aws.sagemaker.FailureReason If the training job failed, the reason it failed.
---@field HyperParameters? aws.sagemaker.HyperParameters Algorithm-specific parameters.
---@field AlgorithmSpecification? aws.sagemaker.AlgorithmSpecification Information about the algorithm used for training, and algorithm metadata.
---@field RoleArn? aws.sagemaker.RoleArn The Amazon Web Services Identity and Access Management (IAM) role configured for the training job.
---@field InputDataConfig? aws.sagemaker.InputDataConfig An array of Channel objects that describes each data input channel.
---@field OutputDataConfig? aws.sagemaker.OutputDataConfig The S3 path where model artifacts that you configured when creating the job are stored. SageMaker creates subfolders for model artifacts.
---@field ResourceConfig? aws.sagemaker.ResourceConfig Resources, including ML compute instances and ML storage volumes, that are configured for model training.
---@field WarmPoolStatus? aws.sagemaker.WarmPoolStatus The status of the warm pool associated with the training job.
---@field VpcConfig? aws.sagemaker.VpcConfig A VpcConfig object that specifies the VPC that this training job has access to. For more information, see Protect Training Jobs by Using an Amazon Virtual Private Cloud.
---@field StoppingCondition? aws.sagemaker.StoppingCondition Specifies a limit to how long a model training job can run. It also specifies how long a managed Spot training job has to complete. When the job reaches the time limit, SageMaker ends the training job. Use this API to cap model training costs.
---@field CreationTime? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp A timestamp that indicates when the training job was created.
---@field TrainingStartTime? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp Indicates the time when the training job starts on training instances. You are billed for the time interval between this time and the value of TrainingEndTime. The start time in CloudWatch Logs might be later than this time. The difference is due to the time it takes to download the training data and to the size of the training container.
---@field TrainingEndTime? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp Indicates the time when the training job ends on training instances. You are billed for the time interval between the value of TrainingStartTime and this time. For successful jobs and stopped jobs, this is the time after model artifacts are uploaded. For failed jobs, this is the time when SageMaker detects a job failure.
---@field LastModifiedTime? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp A timestamp that indicates when the status of the training job was last modified.
---@field SecondaryStatusTransitions? aws.sagemaker.SecondaryStatusTransitions A history of all of the secondary statuses that the training job has transitioned through.
---@field FinalMetricDataList? aws.sagemaker.FinalMetricDataList A list of final metric values that are set when the training job completes. Used only if the training job was configured to use metrics.
---@field EnableNetworkIsolation? aws.sagemaker.Boolean If the TrainingJob was created with network isolation, the value is set to true. If network isolation is enabled, nodes can't communicate beyond the VPC they run in.
---@field EnableInterContainerTrafficEncryption? aws.sagemaker.Boolean To encrypt all communications between ML compute instances in distributed training, choose True. Encryption provides greater security for distributed training, but training might take longer. How long it takes depends on the amount of communication between compute instances, especially if you use a deep learning algorithm in distributed training.
---@field EnableManagedSpotTraining? aws.sagemaker.Boolean When true, enables managed spot training using Amazon EC2 Spot instances to run training jobs instead of on-demand instances. For more information, see Managed Spot Training.
---@field CheckpointConfig? aws.sagemaker.CheckpointConfig
---@field TrainingTimeInSeconds? aws.sagemaker.TrainingTimeInSeconds The training time in seconds.
---@field BillableTimeInSeconds? aws.sagemaker.BillableTimeInSeconds The billable time in seconds.
---@field DebugHookConfig? aws.sagemaker.DebugHookConfig
---@field ExperimentConfig? aws.sagemaker.ExperimentConfig
---@field DebugRuleConfigurations? aws.sagemaker.DebugRuleConfigurations Information about the debug rule configuration.
---@field TensorBoardOutputConfig? aws.sagemaker.TensorBoardOutputConfig
---@field DebugRuleEvaluationStatuses? aws.sagemaker.DebugRuleEvaluationStatuses Information about the evaluation status of the rules for the training job.
---@field OutputModelPackageArn? aws.sagemaker.ModelPackageArn The output model package Amazon Resource Name (ARN) that contains model weights or checkpoint.
---@field ModelPackageConfig? aws.sagemaker.ModelPackageConfig The model package configuration.
---@field ProfilerConfig? aws.sagemaker.ProfilerConfig
---@field Environment? aws.sagemaker.TrainingEnvironmentMap The environment variables to set in the Docker container.
---@field RetryStrategy? aws.sagemaker.RetryStrategy The number of times to retry the job when the job fails due to an InternalServerError.
---@field Tags? aws.sagemaker.TagList An array of key-value pairs. You can use tags to categorize your Amazon Web Services resources in different ways, for example, by purpose, owner, or environment. For more information, see Tagging Amazon Web Services Resources.

---@alias aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobArn string

---Defines the input needed to run a training job using the algorithm.
---@class aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobDefinition
---@field TrainingInputMode aws.sagemaker.TrainingInputMode|string
---@field HyperParameters? aws.sagemaker.HyperParameters The hyperparameters used for the training job.
---@field InputDataConfig aws.sagemaker.InputDataConfig An array of Channel objects, each of which specifies an input source.
---@field OutputDataConfig aws.sagemaker.OutputDataConfig the path to the S3 bucket where you want to store model artifacts. SageMaker creates subfolders for the artifacts.
---@field ResourceConfig aws.sagemaker.ResourceConfig The resources, including the ML compute instances and ML storage volumes, to use for model training.
---@field StoppingCondition aws.sagemaker.StoppingCondition Specifies a limit to how long a model training job can run. It also specifies how long a managed Spot training job has to complete. When the job reaches the time limit, SageMaker ends the training job. Use this API to cap model training costs.

---@alias aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobEarlyStoppingType "Off"|"Auto"

---@alias aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobName string

---@alias aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobSortByOptions "Name"|"CreationTime"|"Status"|"FinalObjectiveMetricValue"

---@alias aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobStatus "InProgress"|"Completed"|"Failed"|"Stopping"|"Stopped"|"Deleting"

---@alias aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobStatusCounter number

---The numbers of training jobs launched by a hyperparameter tuning job, categorized by status.
---@class aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobStatusCounters
---@field Completed? aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobStatusCounter The number of completed training jobs launched by the hyperparameter tuning job.
---@field InProgress? aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobStatusCounter The number of in-progress training jobs launched by a hyperparameter tuning job.
---@field RetryableError? aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobStatusCounter The number of training jobs that failed, but can be retried. A failed training job can be retried only if it failed because an internal service error occurred.
---@field NonRetryableError? aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobStatusCounter The number of training jobs that failed and can't be retried. A failed training job can't be retried if it failed because a client error occurred.
---@field Stopped? aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobStatusCounter The number of training jobs launched by a hyperparameter tuning job that were manually stopped.

---Metadata for a training job step.
---@class aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobStepMetadata
---@field Arn? aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the training job that was run by this step execution.

---@alias aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobSummaries aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobSummary[]

---Provides summary information about a training job.
---@class aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobSummary
---@field TrainingJobName aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobName The name of the training job that you want a summary for.
---@field TrainingJobArn aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the training job.
---@field CreationTime aws.sagemaker.Timestamp A timestamp that shows when the training job was created.
---@field TrainingEndTime? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp A timestamp that shows when the training job ended. This field is set only if the training job has one of the terminal statuses (Completed, Failed, or Stopped).
---@field LastModifiedTime? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp Timestamp when the training job was last modified.
---@field TrainingJobStatus aws.sagemaker.TrainingJobStatus The status of the training job.
---@field SecondaryStatus? aws.sagemaker.SecondaryStatus The secondary status of the training job.
---@field WarmPoolStatus? aws.sagemaker.WarmPoolStatus The status of the warm pool associated with the training job.
---@field TrainingPlanArn? aws.sagemaker.TrainingPlanArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN); of the training plan associated with this training job.

