---Details about an extension to a training plan, including the offering ID, dates, status, and cost information.
---@class aws.sagemaker.TrainingPlanExtension
---@field TrainingPlanExtensionOfferingId aws.sagemaker.TrainingPlanExtensionOfferingId The unique identifier of the extension offering that was used to create this extension.
---@field ExtendedAt? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp The timestamp when the extension was created.
---@field StartDate? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp The start date of the extension period.
---@field EndDate? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp The end date of the extension period.
---@field Status? aws.sagemaker.String256 The current status of the extension (e.g., Pending, Active, Scheduled, Failed, Expired).
---@field PaymentStatus? aws.sagemaker.String256 The payment processing status of the extension.
---@field AvailabilityZone? aws.sagemaker.String256 The Availability Zone of the extension.
---@field AvailabilityZoneId? aws.sagemaker.AvailabilityZoneId The Availability Zone ID of the extension.
---@field DurationHours? aws.sagemaker.TrainingPlanExtensionDurationHours The duration of the extension in hours.
---@field UpfrontFee? aws.sagemaker.String256 The upfront fee for the extension.
---@field CurrencyCode? aws.sagemaker.CurrencyCode The currency code for the upfront fee (e.g., USD).

