---Details of the training plan.
---@class aws.sagemaker.TrainingPlanSummary
---@field TrainingPlanArn aws.sagemaker.TrainingPlanArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN); of the training plan.
---@field TrainingPlanName aws.sagemaker.TrainingPlanName The name of the training plan.
---@field Status aws.sagemaker.TrainingPlanStatus The current status of the training plan (e.g., Pending, Active, Expired). To see the complete list of status values available for a training plan, refer to the Status attribute within the TrainingPlanSummary object.
---@field StatusMessage? aws.sagemaker.TrainingPlanStatusMessage A message providing additional information about the current status of the training plan.
---@field DurationHours? aws.sagemaker.TrainingPlanDurationHours The number of whole hours in the total duration for this training plan.
---@field DurationMinutes? aws.sagemaker.TrainingPlanDurationMinutes The additional minutes beyond whole hours in the total duration for this training plan.
---@field StartTime? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp The start time of the training plan.
---@field EndTime? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp The end time of the training plan.
---@field UpfrontFee? aws.sagemaker.String256 The upfront fee for the training plan.
---@field CurrencyCode? aws.sagemaker.CurrencyCode The currency code for the upfront fee (e.g., USD).
---@field TotalInstanceCount? aws.sagemaker.TotalInstanceCount The total number of instances reserved in this training plan.
---@field AvailableInstanceCount? aws.sagemaker.AvailableInstanceCount The number of instances currently available for use in this training plan.
---@field InUseInstanceCount? aws.sagemaker.InUseInstanceCount The number of instances currently in use from this training plan.
---@field TotalUltraServerCount? aws.sagemaker.UltraServerCount The total number of UltraServers allocated to this training plan.
---@field TargetResources? aws.sagemaker.SageMakerResourceNames The target resources (e.g., training jobs, HyperPod clusters, Endpoints, Studio apps) that can use this training plan.
---@field ReservedCapacitySummaries? aws.sagemaker.ReservedCapacitySummaries A list of reserved capacities associated with this training plan, including details such as instance types, counts, and availability zones.

