---Contains detailed information about a training session.
---@class aws.sagemaker.TrainingSessionDetail
---@field TrainingSessionArn aws.sagemaker.TrainingSessionArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the training session.
---@field TrainingSessionName aws.sagemaker.TrainingSessionName The name of the training session.
---@field TrainingSessionStatus aws.sagemaker.TrainingSessionStatus The current status of the training session.
---@field ModelPackageGroupArn? aws.sagemaker.ModelPackageGroupArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the model package group where checkpoints are published.
---@field CreationTime aws.sagemaker.Timestamp The date and time that the training session was created.
---@field LastModifiedTime? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp The date and time that the training session was last modified.
---@field EndTime? aws.sagemaker.Timestamp The date and time that the training session ended.
---@field ErrorDetails? aws.sagemaker.FailureReason If the training session failed or is blocked, detailed error information.
---@field LastReceivedSequenceNumber? aws.sagemaker.JavaInteger The sequence number of the last training operation received by the session.
---@field BillableTokenUsage? aws.sagemaker.BillableTokenUsage The billable token usage for the training session.
---@field VpcConfig? aws.sagemaker.VpcConfig The Virtual Private Cloud (VPC) configuration for the training session.
---@field RoleArn? aws.sagemaker.RoleArn The Amazon Resource Name (ARN) of the IAM role associated with the training session.
