---@field ModelConfig? aws.sagemaker.TrainingSessionModelConfig The configuration for the base model.
---@field OutputConfig? aws.sagemaker.TrainingSessionOutputConfig The output configuration for the training session.
---@field Tags? aws.sagemaker.TagList The tags associated with the training session.

---The configuration for the base model used in a training session.
