---@field AdditionalCodeRepositories? aws.sagemaker.AdditionalCodeRepositoryNamesOrUrls An array of up to three Git repositories to associate with the notebook instance. These can be either the names of Git repositories stored as resources in your account, or the URL of Git repositories in Amazon Web Services CodeCommit or in any other Git repository. These repositories are cloned at the same level as the default repository of your notebook instance. For more information, see Associa...
---@field AcceleratorTypes? aws.sagemaker.NotebookInstanceAcceleratorTypes This parameter is no longer supported. Elastic Inference (EI) is no longer available.
---@field DisassociateAcceleratorTypes? aws.sagemaker.DisassociateNotebookInstanceAcceleratorTypes This parameter is no longer supported. Elastic Inference (EI) is no longer available.
---@field DisassociateDefaultCodeRepository? aws.sagemaker.DisassociateDefaultCodeRepository The name or URL of the default Git repository to remove from this notebook instance. This operation is idempotent. If you specify a Git repository that is not associated with the notebook instance when you call this method, it does not throw an error.
---@field DisassociateAdditionalCodeRepositories? aws.sagemaker.DisassociateAdditionalCodeRepositories A list of names or URLs of the default Git repositories to remove from this notebook instance. This operation is idempotent. If you specify a Git repository that is not associated with the notebook instance when you call this method, it does not throw an error.
